Cinemor Story Service Database Migrations
=========================================

This directory contains Alembic configuration and migration files
for the Cinemor Story Service.

Database:
    PostgreSQL

Database name:
    cinemor

Migration tool:
    Alembic

Important commands
------------------

Create a new migration:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "migration message"


Apply migrations:

    alembic upgrade head


Rollback the latest migration:

    alembic downgrade -1


Show current migration:

    alembic current


Show migration history:

    alembic history


Migration files
---------------

Generated migration files are stored in:

    alembic/versions/


Do not manually modify generated migration files unless there is
a specific reason to do so.

Database credentials are stored in the service .env file and
must not be committed to source control.